 by allocating capital primarily toward regulated investments in an effort to continue to improve the sustainability and predictability of our business and realizing the value of the consistent and reliable carbon-free generation from our nuclear units.","zh":"我們於 1985 年根據新澤西州法律註冊成立，主要執行辦公室位於 80 Park Plaza, Newark, New Jersey 07102。我們是一家公用事業控股公司，透過我們的全資子公司開展業務，是一家主要受監管的電力和燃氣公用事業公司以及核能發電企業。我們的業務計劃專注於透過將資本主要分配給受監管的投資來實現成長，以繼續提高我們業務的可持續性和可預測性，並實現核電機組持續可靠的無碳發電的價值。"},{"en":"As a holding company, our profitability depends on our subsidiaries' operating results. We principally conduct our business through two direct wholly owned subsidiaries, PSE&G and PSEG Power LLC (PSEG Power), described below, each of which also has its principal executive offices at 80 Park Plaza, Newark, New Jersey 07102.","zh":"作為一家控股公司，我們的獲利能力取決於子公司的經營績效。我們主要透過兩家直接全資子公司 PSE&G 和 PSEG Power LLC (PSEG Power) 開展業務，如下所述，各子公司的主要執行辦公室位於 80 Park Plaza, Newark, New Jersey 07102。"},{"en":"PSE&G—A New Jersey corporation, incorporated in 1924, which is a franchised public utility in New Jersey. It is also the provider of last resort for gas and electric commodity service for end users in its service territory. PSE&G earns revenues from its regulated rate tariffs under which it provides electric transmission and electric and natural gas distribution to residential, commercial and industrial (C&I) customers in its service territory. It also offers appliance services and repairs to customers throughout its service territory and invests in regulated solar generation projects and regulated energy efficiency (EE) and related programs in New Jersey.","zh":"PSE&G—一家新澤西州公司，成立於 1924 年，是新澤西州的一家特許經營公用事業公司。它也是為其服務領域內的最終用戶提供天然氣和電力商品服務的最後手段的提供者。 PSE&G 透過其監管費率獲得收入，根據該費率向其服務區域內的住宅、商業和工業 (C&I) 客戶提供電力傳輸以及電力和天然氣分配。它還在整個服務範圍內向客戶提供電器服務和維修，並在新澤西州投資受監管的太陽能發電項目和受監管的能源效率 (EE) 及相關計劃。"}],"markets":[{"en":"Transmission—the movement of electricity at high voltage from generating plants to substations and transformers, where it is then reduced to a lower voltage for distribution to homes, businesses and industrial customers. Our revenues for these services are based upon tariffs approved by the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission (FERC).","zh":"輸電－高壓電力從發電廠傳輸到變電站和變壓器，然後降低至較低電壓以分配給家庭、企業和工業客戶。我們這些服務的收入是基於聯邦能源管理委員會 (FERC) 批准的關稅。"},{"en":"Distribution—the delivery of electricity and gas to the retail customer's home, business or industrial facility. Our revenues for these services are based upon tariffs approved by the New Jersey Board of Public Utilities (BPU).","zh":"配送－將電力和天然氣輸送到零售客戶的家庭、企業或工業設施。我們這些服務的收入是基於新澤西州公用事業委員會 (BPU) 批准的關稅。"}],"customers":[{"en":"Our regulated T&D public utility, PSE&G, distributes electric energy and natural gas to customers within a designated service territory running diagonally across New Jersey where approximately 6.8 million people, or about 74% of New Jersey's population resides.","zh":"我們受監管的 T&D 公用事業公司 PSE&G 在橫跨新澤西州對角線的指定服務區域內向客戶分配電能和天然氣，該區域居住著約 680 萬人（約佔新澤西州人口的 74%）。"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Public Service Electricand Gas Company","val":9558000000,"zh":"公共服務電力和燃氣公司"},{"name":"PSEG Power Other","val":3752000000,"zh":"PSEG 電源 其他"}],"total":12168000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Electric Distribution Contracts","val":4858000000,"zh":"配電合約"},{"name":"Gas Distribution Contracts","val":2461000000,"zh":"天然氣分配合約"},{"name":"Transmission","val":1779000000,"zh":"傳染"},{"name":"Other Contract Revenues","val":1132000000,"zh":"其他合約收入"}],"total":12168000000}},"peers":["PNW","ETR","PPL","FE","NI"]}}